	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">De servo pistoris <placeName ref="l546">Wiennae</placeName> <placeName ref="l850">Austrię</placeName> combusto <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>haec habeo: Nosti, quomodo sacerdoti</foreign> er hat das sacrament mit der mon<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>strantzen genomen an unsers herte/rregots tag uß den henden, das mit <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fuͤssen getretten zuͦ stucken.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">Den haben sy gefangen ein lange zit, haben <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in wellen bereden</foreign> se peccasse in spiritum sanctum, et si vellet revocare suum erratum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et dicere se a Zwinglianis seductum, tunc mitem sententiam habiturum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod noluit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et perpetuo dixit idololatriam esse crudelissimam, propter quam <persName ref="p18593">Turcam</persName> dominus immiserit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tandem adductus ad iudicem et 1. lingua illi praecisa, ne loqueretur ad populum, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>2. manus ambas amputatę, 3. igne combustus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Constantissimus fuit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et perpetuo in populum oculos suos direxit; multos commovit ad lachrymas pr<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>o<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>fundendas.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Paffi triumphant.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Dixit martyr ad iudices: "Si deus fuit, cur <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>se non defendit, cur me non fulmine perdidit?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Habebitis brevi alios, qui <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vestram superstitionem reprehendent, si illos non audieritis, <persName ref="p18593">Turcę</persName> servi eritis."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Hęc de pistore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> nihil omnino audimus, et quidam heri ad nos venit, qui ex <placeName ref="l808">Belgi<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>s</placeName> rediit, de <persName ref="p18538">Cęsaris</persName> infirmitate varia narrans.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ducis captu filius natu <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>maior in <placeName ref="l825">Dania</placeName> est, regem fortassis sollicitaturus, an posset liberare parentem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>e captivitate illa Caesareana.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l749">Saxonicę</placeName> civitates adhuc se fortiter defendunt <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>contra quorundam nebulonum tyrannides.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">De <placeName>Brunswicensi</placeName> proditione <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>audisti absque dubio.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vigilandum est civitatibus, ne per istas insidias ad<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>obruantur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">15. ianuarii 1550.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> sa<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>lutabis, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName> et praecipue <persName ref="p1214">Frisium</persName> nostrum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Mitto ad te bullam diaboli; nam papa mortuus est, qui hasce... <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>bullas dedit vanissimas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Quum clauderem literas, ad me mittuntur ex <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> hęc tristia: <persName ref="p4744">Fagius</persName> <placeName ref="l86">Cantabrigiae</placeName> ex <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>quartana diutina eaque quasi in tabem desinente <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ad cęlestem patriam die 23. novembris concessit.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName>Latamerus</persName> episcopus laetaliter decumbit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> recte <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>valet, si modo is fidelissimi collegae et exulis morte potest dici recte <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>valere.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Hęc fusius audies brevi absque dubio ipso d. <persName ref="p8121">Montio</persName>, qui literas ex <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> accepit iis diebus, quę et tibi communicabit<note type="margin">a.R.: scheint eher "tu communicabis".</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Doctissimo ac piissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>pastori vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domino suo perpetuo veneran<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>do.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
